# S-173 / TST-9, live: Shift-Cmd-] and [ (next and previous tab). Needs the bracket keys
# in tooling/drive-window.py (tooling-drive-brackets.diff); --check refuses this file
# without them. Same fixture as 50-tst9-keys.steps, before it runs.
activate
wait 3
key 1+cmd
wait 1
key ]+cmd+shift
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-20a-next-tab.png
key [+cmd+shift
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-20b-previous-tab.png
